                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35afeb49-f6d2-3596-a06f-4d37d945ff97",
                        "entry_id": "f1dab40b-f851-303d-b1cb-81383728d9cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ботан., редк. растение, тело которого расчленено на стебель и листья"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "50d029df-8920-43bc-b784-686d2f114dfa",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1dab40b-f851-303d-b1cb-81383728d9cf",
                        "source_sense_id": "35afeb49-f6d2-3596-a06f-4d37d945ff97",
                        "target_lang_word": "cormophyte",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cormophyte",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6f0b4c0-c41c-337d-8a78-60dcde16615c",
                                        "entry_id": "b59c516f-986c-3faf-b8b6-7a788202ee6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any plant having a proper stem or axis of growth, which is distinct from its leaves, phyllophyte"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07fe9118-e5c0-4ec2-b13f-967545ed1ca8",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f0b4c0-c41c-337d-8a78-60dcde16615c",
                                                "text": "Very careful developmental or anatomical investigation may be required to show that the variously-constructed organs of many cormophytes are derived by the metamorphosis of the three primary organs, root, stem, and leaf, and to ascertain with which of these any particular structure is really homologous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0985c7de-e623-469a-9e03-f24bfd75a1e4",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f0b4c0-c41c-337d-8a78-60dcde16615c",
                                                "text": "Botany used to recognize, if vaguely, these two kinds of plant, namely the thallophyte which grew and absorbed superficially, and the cormophyte, which is the root-shoot system with internal accommodation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce544e91-bdb7-40ad-8700-6479d2986b15",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f0b4c0-c41c-337d-8a78-60dcde16615c",
                                                "text": "The morphology of cormophytes exhibits considerable variations in size, appearance of the various parts, and duration of the life cycle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "018a76b0-cb49-413c-ba7f-507ff3a6cee9",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1dab40b-f851-303d-b1cb-81383728d9cf",
                        "source_sense_id": "35afeb49-f6d2-3596-a06f-4d37d945ff97",
                        "target_lang_word": "cormofita",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1a1ad51b-c994-42fb-ab84-4c9ae04c6c84",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1dab40b-f851-303d-b1cb-81383728d9cf",
                        "source_sense_id": "35afeb49-f6d2-3596-a06f-4d37d945ff97",
                        "target_lang_word": "cormophyte",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cormophyte",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5be936b-9cc8-3d43-a654-c3242dbf6f65",
                                        "entry_id": "9d371d4a-3d0b-3d55-abee-dd61d7813b99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Végétal qui est archégoniate, c'est-à-dire, composé d'une tige, de racines et de feuilles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baad9212-f5a2-40aa-a852-0d13e396fbcd",
                                                "sense_id": "f5be936b-9cc8-3d43-a654-c3242dbf6f65",
                                                "text": "L'appellation cormophytes est abandonnée au profit des termes modernes d'embryophytes ou de trachéophytes selon qu'on y inclut ou non les bryophytes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82126f14-e141-4c4d-9bd9-c1163fdd6bf0",
                                                "sense_id": "f5be936b-9cc8-3d43-a654-c3242dbf6f65",
                                                "text": "Dans les Mousses, la génération sexuée est un cormophyte feuillé, se nourrissant lui-même et portant les archégones et les anthéridies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
